  WATCH clock and need no phone data. Slots 1 and 3 hold the two count-mode variants of
  that figure and gate each other (only the active mode has data, so only one renders);
  slot 2 carries the current or next block.
  Slot 4 (first, under everything) is a full-face SMALL_IMAGE the watch app paints: the
  outer ring and 96 ticks in the count-mode colour, a thin arc per category time range
  on that ring, and the per-block arcs (WFF has no loop); see BlockArcsComplicationService.kt.
-->
